`titleHasPrToken` in branchLegGuard requires whole-token `pr-<N>` with prev-char boundary that rejects... prevOk rejects when prev is letter/digit/'-'/'#'. A space or '·' before 'pr-1591' is fine. So placing '· pr-1591' before the leg works for the gate.

